{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中國移動首三季少賺近百分之8。</p><p></p><p>純利1,062億元人民幣，收入7,803億元人民幣，按年減少百分之1.8。當中，主營業務收入佔6,577億元，下跌百分之3.7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T16:40:37.602631+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:37:40.341634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T16:37:45.087089+00:00","content_hash":"ec5bab840cdb72a8efd1b5b6aeea37e203c08b6c186bf6ec815c258708646da1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}